ng systems are compatible; and hands-on maintenance is supported. Prior and current simulations confirm stability of the result. Thus, this option optimally balances performance and requirements.\",\"requirements\":[{\"requirement\":\"The absorber must be one of the three materials listed in candidate_specs.md.\",\"status\":\"met\",\"evidence\":\"Absorber-F2 is one of the three listed absorbers.\"},{\"requirement\":\"The calorimeter must allow hands-on maintenance during shutdowns.\",\"status\":\"met\",\"evidence\":\"All options are compatible with hands-on maintenance (meeting_notes_2026-05-14.md, candidate_specs.md).\"},{\"requirement\":\"Plate thickness between 2 and 10 mm.\",\"status\":\"met\",\"evidence\":\"Chosen plate thickness is 6 mm, within specified limits.\"},{\"requirement\":\"Achieve the best possible energy resolution at 100 GeV.\",\"status\":\"met\",\"evidence\":\"Simulations show Absorber-F2 at 6 mm achieves 3.09% energy resolution, the best among all candidates.\"}]}", "call_id": "call_igPfFKlm9bnysskw0rXZPfEC", "name": "submit_recommendation", "type": "function_call", "id": "fc_04ecf9a99cc82596006afce88cfc4487d0bab41b4b2e223446", "async_": null, "caller": null, "namespace": null, "status": "completed"}]}
